      <p source="#source-250-297"><seg source="#source-250-297">暗き　浜辺　を　たどり来たり、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-297-356"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297-318"><rb>水際</rb><rt>みぎは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-318-356">　真近く　砂　を　握る。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-356-421"><seg source="#source-356-365">握る　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-365-386"><rb>真砂</rb><rt>まさご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-386-421">　の　もろき　うちに、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-421-462"><seg source="#source-421-462">闇の力　は　その尾　振ひ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-462-514"><seg source="#source-462-514">手　をば　つたひて　胸に　響く。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-514-564"><seg source="#source-514-564">君よ、御空　の　星　を　説きて、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-564-623"><seg source="#source-564-600">地なる　ひゞき　を　忘る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-600-615"><rb>勿</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-615-623">れ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-623-685"><seg source="#source-623-647">遠き　深み　の　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-647-662"><rb>浪</rb><rt>なみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-662-685">　は　寄せて、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-685-732"><seg source="#source-685-732">幾重　打ちては　畳む　砂　ぞ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-732-782"><seg source="#source-732-782">たとへ　もろく　ぞ　砕け去りて、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-782-829"><seg source="#source-782-829">手　には　残れる　形　なくも、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-829-908"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-829-847"><rb>永劫</rb><rt>とは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-847-871">　の　憂ひ　を　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-871-883"><rb>布</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-883-908">くは　如何に。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-908-955"><seg source="#source-908-955">暗き　浜辺　に　砂　を　握り、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-955-997"><seg source="#source-955-997">君に　云ふべき事　ぞ　多き。</seg></p>
    </body>
